WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:05.464
I have led our warriors.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.844
I have protected our lands.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.727
I have upheld our gods.

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:28.070
And I will be king of Norway.

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:37.287
This is destiny!

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:41.375
I was born to be
the king of this country.

00:00:44.503 --> 00:00:47.047
There is nothing
that can stand in the way.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.258
Not even Erik Bloodaxe!

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:54.846
He must never be king.

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:58.517
Let the gods bear witness,

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:02.145
for today we fight
 for our way of life!

00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:10.946
Haakon! Haakon! Haakon!

00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:13.323
I will fight for this kingdom,

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:15.742
even if it is against 
my own brothers!

